<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pete's Brewing said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pete's Brewing said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter upgraded Pete's Brewing Co to neutral from swap, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 7-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
